    {
      "subId": "1012213",
      "subQuestName": "Go deeper within and retrieve the diagram of the city's defenses",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101221301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101221301": {
            "id": "101221301",
            "speakerId": 10393,
            "speakerName": "Ivan",
            "text": "Who are you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101221302"
            ]
          },
          "101221302": {
            "id": "101221302",
            "speakerId": 10393,
            "speakerName": "Ivan",
            "text": "Just because someone brought you here, don't think you can wander around."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1012202",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the attacking Fatui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101220201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101220201": {
            "id": "101220201",
            "speakerId": 10407,
            "speakerName": "Observe Chair",
            "text": "(This fancy chair really stands out in front of such an old tattered tent.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220202"
            ]
          },
          "101220202": {
            "id": "101220202",
            "speakerId": 10407,
            "speakerName": "Observe Chair",
            "text": "(Schubert must really treasure this chair. Only a true aristocrat would bother maintaining luxury items in circumstances like this.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1012214",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Eula and say goodbye",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101220701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101220701": {
            "id": "101220701",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "This must be it. They may very well have already made a copy of it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220702"
            ]
          },
          "101220702": {
            "id": "101220702",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "But without my uncle as their puppet, there'd be no use in them attacking the city.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220703"
            ]
          },
          "101220703": {
            "id": "101220703",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Fatui wouldn't have relied only on your uncle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220704"
            ]
          },
          "101220704": {
            "id": "101220704",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "True, but if their plan had hinged purely on taking Mondstadt by force, as opposed to with the help of a puppet, they could have spared themselves the trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220705"
            ]
          },
          "101220705": {
            "id": "101220705",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "The Fatui are dishonest, but they wouldn't go as far as to start an open war. Their opposition wouldn't just be Mondstadt alone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220708"
            ]
          },
          "101220708": {
            "id": "101220708",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "Anyway, I'll inform the Acting Grand Master. She'll know how to handle things from here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220709"
            ]
          },
          "101220709": {
            "id": "101220709",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "By the way, why did you follow us here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220710"
            ]
          },
          "101220710": {
            "id": "101220710",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh yeah, you suddenly appeared at just the right moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220711"
            ]
          },
          "101220711": {
            "id": "101220711",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "Yeah, about that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220712"
            ]
          },
          "101220712": {
            "id": "101220712",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "Because you stole my targets by attacking the Fatui I'd been tracking earlier...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101220713"
            ]
          },
          "101220713": {
            "id": "101220713",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "Eula",
            "text": "...I came to exact my vengeance. You tried to do my job for me, and I'm here to return the favor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1012212",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101221201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101221201": {
            "id": "101221201",
            "speakerId": 10390,
            "speakerName": "Daler",
            "text": "Go on in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1012214",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101221401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101221401": {
            "id": "101221401",
            "speakerId": 10400,
            "speakerName": "Pyotr",
            "text": "Our preparations have been thorough...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101221402"
            ]
          },
          "101221402": {
            "id": "101221402",
            "speakerId": 10400,
            "speakerName": "Pyotr",
            "text": "...But I still can't shake this uneasy feeling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1012299",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "101229901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "101229901": {
            "id": "101229901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Do you think his \"friends\" are the Fatui?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229902"
            ]
          },
          "101229902": {
            "id": "101229902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Things will get sticky if the Fatui happen to recognize you. What should we do?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229903"
            ]
          },
          "101229903": {
            "id": "101229903",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "As you'll see in a moment, there are many already helping us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229904"
            ]
          },
          "101229904": {
            "id": "101229904",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "I heard that this area had already been purged once by the Knights of Favonius, but it's the only place around Mondstadt that is well concealed and spacious enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229905"
            ]
          },
          "101229905": {
            "id": "101229905",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "Although it has fallen into disrepair and does not suit the tastes of the nobility, we simply have to make do for now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229920"
            ]
          },
          "101229920": {
            "id": "101229920",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, s—sorry, um... can we walk any faster?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229921"
            ]
          },
          "101229921": {
            "id": "101229921",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "Of course not. An aristocrat always moves with grace in his steps, moving hurriedly is unacceptable.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229906"
            ]
          },
          "101229906": {
            "id": "101229906",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "As expected, it's the Fatui!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229907"
            ]
          },
          "101229907": {
            "id": "101229907",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "As expected?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229908"
            ]
          },
          "101229908": {
            "id": "101229908",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... b—because we always see them around the city. Um... they must be... very powerful!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229909"
            ]
          },
          "101229909": {
            "id": "101229909",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "Hmph, nothing more than foreign ruffians with power and the ability to flaunt it... But they are favorable business partners.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229910"
            ]
          },
          "101229910": {
            "id": "101229910",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Good thing you're with us, they don't dare to question you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229911"
            ]
          },
          "101229911": {
            "id": "101229911",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "Of course, that is the benefit of prestige. In past times, it would be a dire offense to speak to a nobleman in such a manner.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229912"
            ]
          },
          "101229912": {
            "id": "101229912",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "We could determine a person's fate with the blink of an eye.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229913"
            ]
          },
          "101229913": {
            "id": "101229913",
            "speakerId": 10386,
            "speakerName": "Schubert",
            "text": "Hmph, and such glory will return to me again before long.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229914"
            ]
          },
          "101229914": {
            "id": "101229914",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They're running off in different directions!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229915"
            ]
          },
          "101229915": {
            "id": "101229915",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon remembers that this place is a dead end. Let's take care of the Fatui first and then deal with Schubert later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229916"
            ]
          },
          "101229916": {
            "id": "101229916",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The door is open, let's go!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229918"
            ]
          },
          "101229918": {
            "id": "101229918",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There it is! That's where they've put the diagram!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "101229919"
            ]
          },
          "101229919": {
            "id": "101229919",
            "speakerId": 10391,
            "speakerName": "Sergei",
            "text": "So you've tracked us here, huh? I guess there's no other option but to fight."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}